OL,3,GNEWSABathing warning issued for several
OL,4,Aisland beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been warned not to swim at
OL,7,Fseveral Isle of Wight beaches because
OL,8,Fof water pollution.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency issued a bathing
OL,11,Fwater alert on Wednesday for Gurnard on
OL,12,Fthe north of the island and along the
OL,13,Feast coast in the Shanklin and
OL,14,FBembridge areas.
OL,16,FSouthern Water's River and Seas Watch
OL,17,Fwebsite details outfall releases
OL,18,Faffecting bathing waters in all three
OL,19,Fof the areas.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
